{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56831","headline":"崔球梦妻作诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"崔球梦妻作诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数日相望极，须知意思迷。\n梦魂不怕险，飞过大江西。\n（见《增修诗话总龟前集》卷三五引李颀《古今诗话》）（〖1〗《古今诗话》云：「池阳崔球爲太学生，苦学不归。\n一日，昼梦到其家，见其妻正写字呼之，不应，与之言，不答，眡其所书，乃诗也，曰〖略〗。\n既觉，历历记之。\n数日书至，其妻寄此诗，一字不差。\n验其写诗日，乃球得梦之日也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}